 false:\n\n*If $A$ is a $7\\times 7$ matrix and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$, then $A$ has fewer than $7$ pivot columns.* ×\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=7$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$. Thus $A$ has $7$ pivot columns.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $\\operatorname{Col}(A)=\\mathbb{R}^{7}$." 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673125 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673112 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673125 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673120 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673125 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673130 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673125 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673142 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673125 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673151 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673125 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673125 1077 "selection" 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673125 1078 #edb/ref 17592186673120 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673125 1079 #uuid "64adbc10-22f8-5b06-93cc-be533f313081" 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673126 1080 "II only" 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673126 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673126 1083 #uuid "6cf403e2-fc73-51e8-93ac-21bd4fa4deb1" 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673127 1080 "I only" 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673127 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673127 1083 #uuid "70a7bdca-b802-5569-bfd3-d23438559962" 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673128 1080 "I and II only" 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673128 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673128 1083 #uuid "735ac19d-aa52-5baf-a48d-1b36bd66de03" 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673129 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673123 13194139538748 17592186045443 true] [17592186673129 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673133 1319413953874